  },
  "blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": true,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$(\\sqrt[n]{a}\\cdot\\sqrt[n]{b})^n=(\\sqrt[n]{a})^n\\cdot(\\sqrt[n]{b})^n=ab$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "所以，根据 $n$ 次算术根的定义，等式 $\\sqrt[n]{ab}=\\sqrt[n]{a}\\cdot\\sqrt[n]{b}$",
        "$(a\\geqslant0,b\\geqslant0)$ 是真等式。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "因此，当 $n$ 是任何自然数时，两个非负因数的积的 $n$ 次算",
        "术根等于这两个因数的 $n$ 次算术根的积。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "通过类似的讨论，可以证明 $n$ 次算术根的第二个性质（定",
        "理 $2$）：当 $n$ 是任何自然数时，分子是非负数而分母是正数的",
        "分数的 $n$ 次算术根等于分子的 $n$ 次算术根除以分母的 $n$ 次算",
        "术根。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "我们举出应用这两个定理的例子。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "例 $1$ 求式 $\\sqrt[4]{16\\times81}$ 的值。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "根据定理 $1$ 得：$\\sqrt[4]{16\\times81}=\\sqrt[4]{16}\\times\\sqrt[4]{81}=2\\times3=6$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "例 $2$ 化简 $\\sqrt[3]{2}\\times\\sqrt[3]{4}$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "我们写出等式 $\\sqrt[n]{ab}=\\sqrt[n]{a}\\cdot\\sqrt[n]{b}$（$a\\geqslant0,b\\geqslant0$），",
        "或写成另一形式：$\\sqrt[n]{a}\\cdot\\sqrt[n]{b}=\\sqrt[n]{ab}$。利用这个等式，得到：",
        "$\\sqrt[3]{2}\\times\\sqrt[3]{4}=\\sqrt[3]{2\\times4}=\\sqrt[3]{8}=2$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "例 $3$ 求式 $\\sqrt[3]{2\\frac{10}{27}}$ 的值。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "根据定理 $2$，得",
        "$\\sqrt[3]{2\\frac{10}{27}}=\\sqrt[3]{\\frac{64}{27}}=\\frac{\\sqrt[3]{64}}{\\sqrt[3]{27}}=\\frac{4}{3}=1\\frac{1}{3}$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "现在，我们讨论 $n$ 次算术根的其他性质。我们从例子",
        "着手。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "假设需要比较根式 $\\sqrt{\\sqrt[3]{64}}$ 和 $\\sqrt[6]{64}$ 的值的大小。",
        "$\\sqrt{\\sqrt[3]{64}}=\\sqrt{4}=2$，　　$\\sqrt[6]{64}=\\sqrt[6]{2^6}=2$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "我们看到，这两个式子的值相等，也就是，"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "foot",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "153"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
